emplate:Fact\">異議提出</a>而被移除。<br />致使用者：請搜尋一下條目的標題（來源搜尋：<span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?&amp;as_eq=wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF%E6%B3%A5%22\">\"馬鈴薯泥\"</a> &#8212; <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?q=%22%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF%E6%B3%A5%22\">網頁</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?tbm=nws&amp;q=&amp;as_src=-newswire+-wire+-presswire+-PR+-press+-release+-wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF%E6%B3%A5%22\">新聞</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//books.google.com/books?&amp;as_brr=0&amp;as_pub=-icon&amp;q=%22%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF%E6%B3%A5%22\">書籍</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//scholar.google.com/scholar?&amp;q=%22%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF%E6%B3%A5%22\">學術</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;safe=off&amp;q=%22%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF%E6%B3%A5%22\">圖像</a></span>），以檢查網路上是否存在該主題的更多可靠來源（<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90\" title=\"Wikipedia:可靠來源\">判定指引</a>）。</small></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173184\" /><table class=\"box-How-to plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div class=\"mbox-image-div\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Ambox_important.svg/40px-Ambox_important.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Ambox_important.svg/120px-Ambox_important.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"40\" data-file-height=\"40\" /></span></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">此條目<b>包含<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:NOTGUIDE\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wikipedia:NOTGUIDE\">指南或教學內容</a>。</b><span class=\"hide-when-compact\"></span> <small class=\"date-container\"><i>(<span class=\"date\">2021年3月13日</span>)</i></small><span class=\"hide-when-compact\"><br /><small>請藉由移除或重寫指南段落來改善條目，或在<a href=\"/wiki/Talk:%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF%E6%B3%A5\" title=\"Talk:馬鈴薯泥\">討論頁</a>提出討論。</small></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div></div><span class=\"hide-when-compact\"></span><span class=\"hide-when-compact\"></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div id=\"noteTA-91ce81bb\" class=\"noteTA\"><div class=\"noteTA-group\"><div data-noteta-group-source=\"module\" data-noteta-group=\"Food\"></div></div></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:MashedPotatoes.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/MashedPotatoes.jpg/250px-MashedPotatoes.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"155\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/MashedPotatoes.jpg/500px-MashedPotatoes.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2148\" data-file-height=\"1662\" /></a><figcaption>馬鈴薯泥</figcaption></figure> \n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mushroom_with_Mashed_Potatoes_Pie_7495.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Mushroom_with_Mashed_Potatoes_Pie_7495.JPG/250px-Mushroom_with_Mashed_Potatoes_Pie_7495.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Mushroom_with_Mashed_Potatoes_Pie_7495.JPG/500px-Mushroom_with_Mashed_Potatoes_Pie_7495.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"4000\" data-file-height=\"2248\" /></a><figcaption><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%9F%E5%B7%B4%E5%85%8B\" title=\"星巴克\">星巴克</a>的蘑菇馬鈴薯泥批</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>馬鈴薯泥</b>，是將煮好的<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"馬鈴薯\">馬鈴薯</a>搗至泥狀，是歐美的常見食物。\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"配料\"><span id=\".E9.85.8D.E6.96.99\"></span>配料</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF%E6%B3%A5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：配料\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>常用口感比較綿的馬鈴薯，當然口感不綿的馬鈴薯也是另一種口味。 馬鈴薯搗碎成泥後可加入各種配料和調料：<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%9B%E5%A5%B6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"牛奶\">牛奶</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%BB%84%E6%B2%B9\" title=\"奶油\">奶油</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A4%8D%E7%89%A9%E6%B2%B9\" title=\"植物油\">植物油</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AE%AE%E5%A5%B6%E6%B2%B9\" title=\"鮮奶油\">奶油</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9F%E7%9B%90\" title=\"食鹽\">鹽</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%83%A1%E6%A4%92%E7%B2%89\" title=\"胡椒粉\">胡椒粉</a>等。常見的調料有<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E8%92%9C\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"大蒜\">大蒜</a>，<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A5%B6%E9%85%AA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"起司\">起司</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9F%B9%E6%A0%B9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"培根\">培根</a>粒、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%85%B8%E5%A5%B6%E6%B2%B9\" title=\"酸奶油\">酸奶油</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%8B%E8%91%B1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"洋蔥\">洋蔥</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9D%92%E8%94%A5\" title=\"青蔥\">青蔥</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8A%A5%E6%9C%AB\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"芥末\">芥末</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%90%E8%8A%B9\" title=\"歐芹\">香芹</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BF%B7%E8%BF%AD%E9%A6%99\" title=\"迷迭香\">迷迭香</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8A%9C%E8%8F%81\" title=\"蕪菁\">蕪菁</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8C%B4%E9%A6%99\" title=\"茴香\">茴香</a>等。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>常和<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A6%99%E8%82%A0\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"香腸\">香腸</a>一起食用。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"做法\"><span id=\".E5.81.9A.E6.B3.95\"></span>做法</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF%E6%B3%A5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：做法\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>馬鈴薯一般要去皮，然後放到水裡煮。如果煮的時間過長，馬鈴薯中的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9B%B4%E9%93%BE%E6%B7%80%E7%B2%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"直鏈澱粉\">直鏈澱粉</a>會從細胞中游離出來，使馬鈴薯泥變粘。為了避免發生這種情況，可以把馬鈴薯切成小塊來煮。因為如果用大塊或整個馬鈴薯來煮，內外會受熱不均勻，內部煮好，外部就煮「過」了。Heston Blumenthal建議在70 °C水中煮40分鐘。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>也可將切片的馬鈴薯在沸水中煮熟（約10-12分鐘）。不建議使用<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%90%85%E6%8B%8C%E6%9C%BA\" class=\"mw-redirect mw-disambig\" title=\"攪拌機\">攪拌機</a>，因為它會打破細胞，使直鏈澱粉游離出來。最好用<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"壓粒器\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"potato ricer\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%A3%93%E7%B2%92%E5%99%A8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"壓粒器（頁面不存在）\">壓粒器</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/potato_ricer\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:potato ricer\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">potato ricer</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>把馬鈴薯搗碎。其他配料一般在最後一步加入，加早了會影響搗碎馬鈴薯。\n此外，現在市面上也有售賣可供即食的沖泡式馬鈴薯粉\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"舂洋芋\"><span id=\".E8.88.82.E6.B4.8B.E8.8A.8B\"></span>舂馬鈴薯</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF%E6%B3%A5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：舂馬鈴薯\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>舂馬鈴薯是雲南版本的馬鈴薯泥，用杵臼將蒸熟並去皮的馬鈴薯舂至產生黏性，拌入蔥、香菜和黃瓜等配料食用。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"参考文献\"><span id=\".E5.8F.82.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8C.AE\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A6%AC%E9%88%B4%E8%96%AF%E6%B3%A5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles